WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.825
This query applies several product rules in priority
order It checks

00:00:05.851 --> 00:00:12.216
for a missing product name missing price invalid
price and negative stock If

00:00:12.242 --> 00:00:17.901
none of those selected rules fail the row passes the
selected checks A

00:00:17.927 --> 00:00:22.506
production system might store several issue codes
instead of only the first one but this

00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:25.138
CASE expression is a clear beginner-friendly start
